```

If user selects credential:
```bash
# Remove from storage
TEMP_FILE=$(mktemp)
jq 'del(.[] | select(.id == ($ID|tonumber)))' "$STORAGE_FILE" > "$TEMP_FILE" && mv "$TEMP_FILE" "$STORAGE_FILE"

echo "Credential deleted successfully!"
```

